// Server messages in all five languages: [en, hi, mr, bn, ta]. See docs/I18N.md sections 2-5.
// Shared with the browser by scripts/sync-core.sh (frontend/core/messages.js is a copy).
//
// Stored shapes (English `text`/`title`/`body` stay as the fallback for old rows, logs and SNS):
//   error         { error, code, params }          → MSG['err.' + code]
//   notification  { key, params, title, body }     → MSG[key + '.title'], MSG[key + '.body']
//   timeline / passport event { key, params, text } → MSG[key]
//   pickup item   { key, params, label }           → MSG[key]
//   alert         { key, params, message }         → MSG[key]
//   recommendation { rule, component, params, action, why } → MSG['rule.<rule>.action'], MSG['rule.<rule>.why']
// Params hold typed references ({ comp: [cat, comp] }, { cat }, { area }, { opt }, { gate }, { msg, params },
// { money }, { kg }, { date }) for anything translatable; IDs, names and models are plain values.
